title: Fatima_Day1
tags: 
position: -7,-175
---

<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite FatimaDhaba>>

// Scene Setup - Day 1 at the dhaba during lunch rush
After hearing his mother mention struggles of local business owners, Raju visits Fatima's dhaba during lunch rush to see if the friendly restaurant owner needs assistance.

Aromatic scents of fresh spices fill the air as Raju approaches the small dhaba. The lunch rush has created chaos - hungry customers, steaming pots, orders called out faster than they can be fulfilled. Fatima moves with practiced efficiency, but sweat on her brow suggests even her experience is being tested.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Sad">>
Fatima: Arre beta, perfect timing, but also terrible timing!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Sad">>
Fatima: I'm drowning in orders and my usual helper couldn't come today. Every pot needs stirring, every plate needs serving.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Sad">>
Fatima: And these customers are getting restless.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Fatima aunty, you look completely overwhelmed!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Is there anything I can do to help? I have some free time and I'd love to learn about running a dhaba.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Help? Beta, this isn't child's play.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Running a dhaba means handling hot oil, sharp knives, impatient customers, and money all at the same time.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: One mistake and someone gets burned, orders get mixed up, or I lose customers forever.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: I understand it's serious work, aunty. But I'm careful and I learn quickly.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: Maybe I could start with something simple, just to help reduce your stress a little?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Simple? Child, there's nothing simple about feeding hungry people!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Every dal has to be perfectly spiced, every roti has to be fresh and hot.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Every customer has to leave satisfied or they won't come back. This business feeds my family - it can't afford mistakes.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: That's exactly why I want to help! You work so hard to take care of everyone in the neighborhood.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Surely there's some small way I could assist without getting in your way?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Quizzical">>
Fatima: You really want to help? Even knowing how hot and chaotic it gets here?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Quizzical">>
Fatima: Most children run away when they see the reality of restaurant work - the heat, the pressure, the constant demands.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I'm not afraid of hard work, aunty.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: My mother taught me that honest labor is something to be proud of, not to run away from.

<<HideCharacter>>
As Raju leaves the dhaba, he carries admiration for Fatima's skill under pressure and determination to prove his offer represents genuine commitment. The complexity of managing everything simultaneously has opened his eyes to sophisticated multitasking that successful restaurant ownership requires.

<<set $Fatima_Day = 2>>
<<EndEvent true>>
===

title: Fatima_Day2
tags: 
---

<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite FatimaDhaba>>

// Scene Setup - Day 2 during morning preparation
Despite yesterday's chaotic introduction, Raju returns during morning preparation time, hoping to observe how Fatima organizes before the lunch rush.

The dhaba carries completely different energy in the morning. Fatima methodically prepares ingredients - chopping vegetables, measuring spices, arranging her station with precision. The peaceful atmosphere contrasts sharply with yesterday's frenzy, revealing the careful planning that makes successful service possible.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Smiling">>
Fatima: Back again, beta? I thought yesterday's madness might have scared you away from restaurant life forever.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Smiling">>
Fatima: Most people don't realize how much work happens before the first customer even arrives.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Actually, aunty, watching you work yesterday made me more interested, not less.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I've never seen anyone handle so many different tasks at once while staying calm under pressure.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Calm? Ha! Inside I was panicking, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: But customers can smell fear just like they can smell burnt food.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: If they see you stressed, they lose confidence in your cooking. That's the first rule - never let them see you sweat, even when you're drowning.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Quizzical">>
Raju: How did you learn to manage everything so well?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Quizzical">>
Raju: Did someone teach you, or did you figure it out through experience?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Sad">>
Fatima: My husband and I started this dhaba together fifteen years ago.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Sad">>
Fatima: He handled the business side while I focused on cooking. But after he passed away three years ago, I had to learn everything.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Sad">>
Fatima: Money management, customer relations, inventory, supplier negotiations - all while maintaining food quality.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: I'm sorry about your husband, aunty.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: It must be incredibly difficult to run everything alone while also dealing with loss.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Difficult, yes. But also necessary.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: This dhaba feeds my two children, pays their school fees, and provides for my mother-in-law.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: When you have people depending on you, you find strength you didn't know existed.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: That's exactly why I want to help, aunty.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Even small assistance could give you more time to focus on important things instead of worrying about every tiny detail.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Quizzical">>
Fatima: You keep saying you want to help, but help means different things to different people.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Quizzical">>
Fatima: What exactly do you think you could contribute to a business like this?

<<HideCharacter>>
As their conversation concludes with Fatima's direct question, Raju understands his persistent offers have moved beyond polite rejection into serious consideration. The revelation of her personal challenges has transformed his motivation from casual helpfulness into genuine commitment.

<<set $Fatima_Day = 3>>
<<EndEvent true>>
===

title: Fatima_Day3
tags: 
position: -75,-229
---

<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite FatimaDhaba>>

// Scene Setup - Day 3 during pre-lunch preparation
With Fatima's question weighing on his mind, Raju returns during pre-lunch preparation, ready to demonstrate rather than simply describe how he might assist.

The dhaba buzzes with anticipatory energy as Raju arrives during the crucial transition between morning prep and lunch service. Today feels different - yesterday's honest conversation has created an atmosphere of mutual evaluation.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Well beta, you've been asking to help for three days now.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Today I'm busy enough to give you a real test. But first, tell me - how do you think you could best contribute to my dhaba?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I've been watching and thinking, aunty.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: There are several ways I could help, but I want to focus on what would make the biggest difference for you.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Show me you understand this business beyond just wanting to help. What specific approach would you take?

<<AutoAdvance true>>
Make a Choice
<<AutoAdvance false>>

-> Raju: I want to learn proper cooking, aunty. Help me understand your recipes and techniques.
    <<jump Fatima_Day3a>>
-> Raju: Let me focus on customer service, aunty. I'll make sure customers feel welcomed and satisfied.
    <<jump Fatima_Day3b>>
-> Raju: I want to help with organization and efficiency, aunty. Let me observe and suggest improvements.
    <<jump Fatima_Day3c>>

===

title: Fatima_Day3a
tags:
position: -308,129
---
<<set $Fatima_Path = "a">>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Cooking? Beta, this isn't home cooking where mistakes just mean dinner tastes bad.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Restaurant cooking means consistent quality, proper timing, and safety standards.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: One undercooked dish could make customers sick.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I understand the responsibility, aunty.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: But I'm willing to start with basic tasks and learn gradually. I want to understand the heart of your business - the food itself.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Very well. But you start with vegetable preparation only.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: No cooking near heat until you prove you understand food safety and can follow instructions exactly.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Thank you for the chance, aunty! I'll be the most careful and attentive assistant you've ever had.

<<HideCharacter>>
As Raju begins his introduction to restaurant food preparation under Fatima's watchful guidance, both understand his choice represents commitment to understanding the technical foundation of her business. Starting with basic vegetable preparation reflects respect for the complexity of professional cooking.

<<set $Fatima_Day = 4>>
<<EndEvent true>>
===

