<<set $Fatima_Path = "b">>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Customer service? Beta, handling customers means dealing with complaints and managing expectations.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: You'll be representing my business. If you're rude or make mistakes, customers blame me, not you.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I understand the responsibility, aunty.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: But I'm polite, I learn quickly, and I want customers to have such good experiences that they become regular visitors.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Customer relations can make or break a small business.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Very well - you can help with serving and basic customer interaction, but any problems come to me immediately.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I won't let you down, aunty! Every customer will leave here feeling valued and satisfied.

<<HideCharacter>>
As Raju prepares for customer service responsibilities, both recognize his choice represents desire to understand the human side of restaurant operations. The decision to trust him with customer interactions reflects Fatima's growing confidence in his maturity.

<<set $Fatima_Day = 4>>
<<EndEvent true>>
