title: Fatima_Day3c
tags:
position: 184,122
---
<<set $Fatima_Path = "c">>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Quizzical">>
Fatima: Organization? Beta, I've been running this dhaba for fifteen years.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Quizzical">>
Fatima: You think a young boy can spot problems that I haven't already considered?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Not problems, aunty - opportunities!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Sometimes a fresh perspective can see possibilities that experience might overlook. Let me study your workflow and suggest small improvements.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Interesting approach. Very well - observe everything, take notes, and we'll discuss your ideas.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: But remember, any changes must be practical and cost-effective.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I'll approach this scientifically, aunty! Every suggestion will be based on careful observation and practical benefit.

<<HideCharacter>>
As Raju embarks on systematic analysis of dhaba operations, both understand his choice represents an unusual approach combining respect for Fatima's experience with confidence in his analytical abilities. The decision reflects his belief that intellectual contribution might prove as valuable as physical assistance.

