title: Fatima_Day4a
tags:
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite FatimaDhaba>>

// Day 4 - Path A: Learning Cooking Skills
After yesterday's selection, Raju arrives early to begin implementing his chosen approach before the lunch rush tests his abilities under real pressure.

The dhaba welcomes Raju's early arrival as he prepares to put commitments into practice. The morning calm provides ideal conditions for beginning his role without peak service pressure. Fatima's evaluation today will determine whether his assistance becomes regular or remains well-intentioned but impractical.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Ready for your first real day of dhaba work, beta?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Today you'll discover whether your enthusiasm survives contact with actual restaurant demands.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I'm more than ready, aunty!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I've been thinking about this all night and I'm eager to prove that my help can make a real difference.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: We'll see how you handle the pressure when orders start piling up and customers get impatient.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Restaurant work tests both your skills and your character under stress.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I understand, aunty.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: But I believe that helping you succeed will teach me valuable lessons about hard work, responsibility, and serving others.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Smiling">>
Fatima: Your attitude is good, beta. Now let's see if your performance matches your promises.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Smiling">>
Fatima: The lunch rush starts in one hour.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Let me show you the basics of what you'll be handling today. Pay close attention.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I'm ready to learn, aunty. Show me everything.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: First rule - safety comes before speed. A mistake here doesn't just cost money, it can hurt people.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Always be aware of hot surfaces, sharp objects, and moving around quickly in tight spaces.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: I'll be extra careful, aunty. Safety first, always.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Second rule - consistency. Every customer deserves the same quality whether it's the first order or the fiftieth.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: When you get tired, that's when mistakes happen. You have to push through.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: I understand. Quality can never drop, no matter how busy we get.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Smiling">>
Fatima: Good! Third rule - stay calm. If you panic, I panic, and then customers panic.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Smiling">>
Fatima: We work as a team, communicating clearly and supporting each other.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Teamwork! I like that, aunty. We'll handle anything that comes our way together.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Fatima" "Serious">>
Fatima: Here come the first customers. Remember everything I taught you. Let's begin!

<<HideCharacter>>
As the lunch rush intensifies with Raju taking on his designated responsibilities, both understand the next few hours will provide definitive evidence of whether his assistance represents genuine value. The mounting pressure will test not only technical abilities but also capacity to maintain quality and composure when customer satisfaction depends on flawless execution.

<<set $Fatima_Day = 5>>
<<EndEvent true>>
===

